"This file isn’t a Vauta backup, or it is incomplete." = "이 파일은 Vauta 백업이 아니거나 불완전합니다.";

/* Passage viewer: the file is only a placeholder of a cloud service (Google Drive, Dropbox, iCloud Drive…); Vauta does not download it and the stored passage is shown instead */
"This file isn’t on this Mac, so Vauta shows the saved passage" = "이 파일은 이 Mac에 없어서 Vauta가 저장된 구간을 표시합니다";

/* Documents pane: the folder holds a source that was added before; the argument is that source's name */
