"This line is what you said: count it in answers, search and exports, and in the minutes the next time they are written" = "이 줄은 내가 한 말입니다. 답변, 검색, 내보내기에 포함되며 다음에 회의록을 작성할 때도 포함됩니다";

/* Speaker edit error: the transcript segment was removed meanwhile */
"This line no longer exists." = "이 줄은 더 이상 존재하지 않습니다.";

/* Settings → Live answers: source the answers may use */
"This meeting" = "이 회의";

/* Exported answer to a question heard in the meeting: it was verified in the meeting itself; the argument is the moments, like 04:10, 12:03 */
